When your character dies in the middle of a multiple-turn [in]action,
you get "while helpless" appended to the death-reason.
This patch changes that to be more descriptive, so you can get, eg.
"while disrobing" or "while sleeping off a magical draught".

WARNING: I haven't tested this extensively, some of the messages
need more polishing, and i'm sure there's a potential buffer overflow
lurking in the code that handles the record and logfile.

